codex
The pre-fix regression run produced the expected failures: the binary `0.12−0.08` and `0.40−0.25` endpoint errors are serialized above their declared tolerances, asymptomatic coverage drops to `0.8`, the decisive joint case drops to `2/5`, and cancellation leaves a nonzero bias residue. I’m now centralizing declared-grid subtraction in Decimal helpers and making `evaluate_p01` use Decimal for recovery/bias predicates while keeping existing emitted fields as floats.
